  {'id':'d282_174','subject':'da-282','question':'The Queen of spices cardamom is mainly grown in:','options':['Punjab and Haryana','Rajasthan and Gujarat','Kerala and Karnataka (Cardamom Hills)','Maharashtra and Goa'],'correct':2,'explanation':'Cardamom is primarily grown in Kerala and Karnataka (in the Cardamom Hills / Idukki district of Kerala), which produce most of India\'s cardamom.','difficulty':'medium'},
